## ⚙️ Config

### OT-Core-SW

```cisco
hostname OT-Core-SW
vlan 10
 name OT
vlan 20
 name IT

interface vlan 10
 ip address 192.168.10.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown

interface vlan 20
 ip address 10.0.0.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown

interface f0/10
 switchport mode access
 switchport access vlan 10
 no shutdown

interface f0/20
 switchport mode access
 switchport access vlan 20
 no shutdown

ip routing
```
